==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid64_2Grid44.svg|32px]] '''Silk ControlGrid64_2Grid44''' command creates a ControlGrid64 from two [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlGrid44|ControlGrid44]] objects that share a corner.

