==Usage==

# Select Select two [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlGrid44|ControlGrid44]] objects that share an edge.
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_ControlGrid64_2Grid44.svg|16px]] ControlGrid64_2Grid44}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid64_2Grid44.svg|16px]] ControlGrid64_2Grid44}} option from the menu.
# A '''ControlGrid64_2Grid44''' object, is created.

== Properties ==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

A  '''ControlGrid64_2Grid44''' is derived from a [[Part_Feature|Part feature]], or more precise a {{Incode|Part::FeaturePython}} object, and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional properties:

{{Properties_Title|C1 - Inputs}}

* {{PropertyData|Grid_0|Link}}: First reference 4X4 grid.
* {{PropertyData|Grid_1|Link}}: Second reference 4X4 grid.
* {{PropertyData|autoG3|Bool}}: Default is {{value|False}}. Activates G3 continuity.
* {{PropertyData|reverse|Bool}}: Default is {{value|False}}. Reverses the surface normal direction.
* {{PropertyData|scale_inner_0|FloatList}}: Default is {{value|[2.0, 2.0, 2.0, 2.0]}}. First side inner scale.
* {{PropertyData|scale_inner_1|FloatList}}: Default is {{value|[2.0, 2.0, 2.0, 2.0]}}. Second side inner scale.
* {{PropertyData|scale_tangent_0|Float}}: Default is {{value|2.0}}. First grid tangent scale.
* {{PropertyData|scale_tangent_1|Float}}: Default is {{value|2.0}}. Second grid tangent scale.
* {{PropertyData|tolerance|Float}}: Default is {{value|1e-06}}. Point-to-point connection tolerance for the shared edge.

{{Properties_Title|C2 - Outputs}}

* {{PropertyData|Legs|Part::PropertyGeometryList}}: Control segments.
* {{PropertyData|Poles|VectorList}}: Poles.
* {{PropertyData|Weights|FloatList}}: Weights.

{{Properties_Title|C3 - Identifiers}}

* {{PropertyData|internalName|String}}: The permanent internal FreeCAD name for this object.
* {{PropertyData|object_type|String}}: Default is {{value|ControlGrid64_2Grid44}}. The workbench class used to create this object.
* {{PropertyData|object_version|String}}: The class version of this object.


